Subject: [PATCH v4 3/5] dt-bindings: display: ti,j721e-dss: Add dt-schema yaml binding
Date:   Thu, 19 Dec 2019 10:23:17 +0200
Message-ID: <89db418c91689beb6e63e0c3c99b39655948b429.1576704528.git.jsarha@ti.com>
